&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%B1%82%E5%8A%A9" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日求助&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5recursion" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日recursion&lt;/span>&lt;/a> （？）&lt;br>长话短说：我想写个脚本儿解这个游戏，试了试回溯，但过于复杂解不出来（12*12的棋盘）。不知社友儿有没有高招儿 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;br>这个游戏叫reflection（反射），玩儿家要在棋盘里放镜子，使得光线路径长度符合要求。具体规则及试玩儿可以去这里：&lt;br>&lt;a href="https://boardgamearena.com/gamepanel?game=laserreflection" rel="noopener noreferrer">&lt;span>https://&lt;/span>&lt;span>boardgamearena.com/gamepanel?g&lt;/span>&lt;span>ame=laserreflection&lt;/span>&lt;/a>&lt;br>（这个游戏挺好玩儿的，不过最难的模式我基本解不开 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> ） &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/68996c9cf4c6db7d8438.png" alt=":doge_a1:" title=":doge_a1:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> &lt;br>顺便儿欢迎大家加我bga好友儿，我id是father_father &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/aa653413e41c8f7de0de.png" alt=":wdg:" title=":wdg:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;br>&lt;a href="https://boardgamearena.com/player?id=85357160" rel="noopener noreferrer">&lt;span>https://&lt;/span>&lt;span>boardgamearena.com/player?id=8&lt;/span>&lt;span>5357160&lt;/span>&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>